culator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Jackson County, April to May came in under 90% of normal in 30 of 75 years since 1951, and November to December did in 37. In 2025 the middle ran 35% of normal in February to March and 59% in August to September. So far in 2026 the middle shows 135% in April to May and 132% in June to July. Grid 23237 had its driest year in 1988 at 53% of normal.</p>"}
